<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The lead&nbsp;{!Lead.Name}&nbsp;from&nbsp;{!Lead.Company}&nbsp;assigned to you with a lead stage of MAQL, and the Lead Status has not
been set to “Accepted” or “Rejected” within the SLA time for a&nbsp;{!Lead.Core_Lead_Priority__c}&nbsp;priority lead&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Click&nbsp;<a href="{!Lead.Link}">here&nbsp;</a>to visit this lead record in SFDC</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As a reminder, the following SLA is expected for any MAQL lead assigned to you:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt;&nbsp; if Hot): Lead Status must be set to “accepted” or “rejected” within 1 business day&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; if Warm): Lead Status must be set to “accepted” or “rejected” within 2 business days&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; if Cold): Lead Status must be set to “accepted” or “rejected” within 4 business days&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please disposition your lead by updating the Lead Status as soon as possible</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">. Any leads not updated will be collected and a list of stagnant leads along with lead owners will be sent to your team lead weekly.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you, please refer to&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/lead-management/">this document</a></span></font><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;if you have questions regarding how to manage any lead assigned to you or claimed by you.</span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>